74
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:41,050
Speaker 1: So the Bible passes this biographical test in the number of the manuscript and also in the years apart.

75
00:06:41,210 --> 00:06:51,050
Speaker 2: Another test that we can take the Bible through to see and validate its authenticity is called the internal evidence test.

76
